{"ar": "تحويل المصادر بالأرقام (مثال 4.8)", "checks": 3, "course": "circuits-1", "file": "matlab/dl/ml-c1-techniques-8.m", "id": "ml-c1-techniques-8", "lesson": "c1-techniques-8", "level": "", "sections": [{"ar": ["40 V مع 5 Ω ← 8 A، ثم 20 ∥ 5 = 4 Ω ← 32 V، ثم 4 + 6 + 10 = 20 Ω ← 1.6 A، ثم 20 ∥ 30 = 12 Ω ← 19.2 V. التيار = (19.2 − 6)/16."], "code": "par = @(a, b) a*b/(a + b);\ni1 = 40/5;  R1 = par(20, 5);  v1 = i1*R1;\nR2 = R1 + 6 + 10;  i2 = v1/R2;  R3 = par(R2, 30);  v3 = i2*R3;\nI = (v3 - 6) / (4 + R3); p6 = 6*I;\nfprintf('8 A -> %g V -> %g A -> %g V, I = %g A, p(6 V) = %g W (absorbing)\\n', v1, i2, v3, I, p6)", "fig": null, "out": "8 A -> 32 V -> 1.6 A -> 19.2 V, I = 0.825 A, p(6 V) = 4.95 W (absorbing)", "project": false, "t": "Example 4.8 step by step"}, {"ar": ["للتحقق نحل الدائرة الأصلية بالعقد: a فوق 30 Ω، و b فوق 20 Ω، و c أسفل 20 Ω (بين 10 Ω والمصدر 40 V)."], "code": "G = [1/4 + 1/30 + 1/6, -1/6,              0\n     -1/6,             1/6 + 1/20 + 1/5, -1/20 - 1/5\n     0,                -1/20 - 1/5,       1/20 + 1/10 + 1/5];\nV = G \\ [6/4; 40/5; -40/5];\nIc = (V(1) - 6) / 4;\nfprintf('current into the 6 V source = %g A\\n', Ic)", "fig": null, "out": "current into the 6 V source = 0.825 A", "project": false, "t": "Check with node voltages"}, {"ar": ["مشروع: مثال 4.9: نحذف 125 Ω و 10 Ω (الحالة الخاصة)، ثم 10 A − 8 A = 2 A على 25 ∥ 100 ∥ 20 = 10 Ω فـ vo = 20 V."], "code": "Rp = 1/(1/25 + 1/100 + 1/20);\nvo = (250/25 - 8) * Rp;\nfprintf('vo = %g V\\n', vo)", "fig": null, "out": "vo = 20 V", "project": true, "t": "Project idea: Example 4.9"}], "title": "Source Transformation, Proved Numerically (Example 4.8)"}